inal", "final": "I booked Dana Lee's trip. The flight and the hotel are both confirmed, and nothing was booked twice.\n\n- **Flight (R0001):** F100, nonstop from SFO to JFK on 2026-11-12, for $289. This was the cheapest nonstop. There's a $199 option, but it has one stop.\n- **Hotel (R0002):** Midtown Lodge in New York, 2 nights checking in 2026-11-12, at $189/night for a total of $378. This was the cheapest hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total charged to the corporate card:** $667. That's under the $1,000 limit, so manager approval wasn't needed.\n\nThe flight and hotel ended up as two separate bookings, not one combined trip. I first tried to book them together, but the request timed out. When I checked Dana's reservations, only the flight had gone through, so I booked the hotel by itself.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01M6ZQfJHapZsDigXHBbdi5G", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01KUSU6Z38jDQhT1ihgVgRbh", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01NZj5RtDxbstku4ZuANVWzd", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under the $1000 approval threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_014R4Ro86wQeAk93cRgHB1bh", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-2026-11-12"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": 